<title>HONG KONG: Jardine names communications director.</title>
<headline>Jardine names communications director.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jardine Fleming said on Tuesday it has appointed David Dodwell as the group's director of corporate communications and public affairs.</p>
<p>Dodwell will take up the newly created post from January 1, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
